nto a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI. One helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/accessibilityCustomContent(_:_:importance:)-4k44i":{"title":"accessibilityCustomContent(_:_:importance:)","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/accessibilityCustomContent(_:_:importance:)-4k44i","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/accessibilitycustomcontent(_:_:importance:)-4k44i","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"accessibilityCustomContent","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"LocalizedStringKey","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI18LocalizedStringKeyV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Text","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4TextV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"importance","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AXCustomContent","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)AXCustomContent"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Importance","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@E@AXCustomContentImportance"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ModifiedContent","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI15ModifiedContentV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Acces